Depends: sqlmap,
         gobuster,
         ffuf,
         wfuzz,
         dirb,
         whatweb,
         cewl,
         sslscan,
         testssl.sh,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: FlickOS security kit: web application testing
 sqlmap, ffuf, gobuster, wfuzz, dirb, WhatWeb and CeWL from Debian, with
 sslscan and testssl.sh to check a server's TLS.
 .
 Burp Suite, ZAP and nikto aren't in Debian's main archive, so they aren't
 part of the kit.
 .
 Use these tools only on computers and networks you own or have permission
 to test.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Security Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used
 (docs/design/flickos-security.md).
